[{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#qualifying_child_roster_complete_32"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","1000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#disqualified_interest_dividends_32i2A"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#disqualified_tax_exempt_interest_32i2B"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#disqualified_rent_royalty_excess_32i2C"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","2000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#capital_gain_net_income"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#disqualified_passive_excess_32i2E"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","Joint"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:income_individual:clir#filing_status"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#eic_eligible_individual"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:child1","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#earned_income_credit_qualifying_child"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:child2","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#earned_income_credit_qualifying_child"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","32000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#earned_income_32"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","35000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:gross_income:clir#adjusted_gross_income"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"negated":true,"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#in_disallowance_period_32k"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"negated":true,"predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#short_taxable_year_under_12_months_32"}],"id":"complete-eitc","question":"Using law as of June 30, 2025, calculate the 2025 EITC amount only. Filing status is joint; EITC eligibility is established. The complete qualifying-child roster consists of exactly two named qualifying children, whose classifications are established. Earned income is $32,000; established AGI is $35,000. Investment income consists of $1,000 interest and $2,000 net capital gain; there is no tax-exempt interest, rent/royalty excess or passive excess; the year is not short, and no §32(k) disallowance period applies. These are explicit calculation inputs, not facts you should infer. Use the published 2025 joint threshold and show the phaseout result.","scope":"Credit amount with eligibility and qualifying-child classifications explicitly established; not an eligibility adjudication or a whole tax return.","steps":[{"label":"earned_income_credit","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-credits","predicate":"urn:us:irc:credits:clir#earned_income_credit"}}],"title":"EITC · two children and phaseout","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","2025-06-30"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#sale_or_disposition"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","2025-06-30","100000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:core#adjusted_basis"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","20000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#money_received"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","130000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#fmv_of_property_received"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","urn:irc:example:new","2025-06-30"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#like_kind_exchange"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:old"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#real_property"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:old"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#us_real_property"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#held_for_productive_use_or_investment"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:new"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#real_property"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:new"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#us_real_property"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:new"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#held_for_productive_use_or_investment"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","20000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#boot_money_received"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#boot_other_property_fmv"}],"id":"complete-exchange","question":"On June 30, 2025 a taxpayer completes a qualifying simultaneous §1031 exchange of two US investment real properties of like kind. The relinquished property has adjusted basis $100,000. They receive replacement property worth $130,000 and $20,000 cash. No liabilities, other property or related parties are involved. Calculate realized gain, recognized boot gain and the replacement basis.","scope":"Single-property qualifying exchange; no liabilities, other boot, related parties or allocation across multiple received properties.","steps":[{"label":"gain_realized","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-property-transactions","predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#gain_realized"}},{"label":"gain_recognized","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-property-transactions","predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#gain_recognized"}},{"label":"like_kind_received_basis","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:new","2025-06-30","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-property-transactions","predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#like_kind_received_basis"}}],"title":"§1031 · gain, boot and received basis","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","20000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#money_distributed"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","50000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distributee_outside_basis_before_distribution"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:property","40000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distributed_property_pre_limitation_basis"}],"id":"complete-partnership","question":"A nonliquidating partnership distribution on June 30, 2025 consists of $20,000 cash and one property. Outside basis immediately beforehand is $50,000; partnership basis of the property is $40,000. No marketable securities, liability change, §737 gain or §751(b) exchange applies. Calculate §731 gain, §732 property basis and remaining §733 outside basis.","scope":"Single-property nonliquidating distribution, no marketable securities, liabilities, §737 or §751 recharacterization. The more complex sale-and-liability scenario remains separate.","steps":[{"label":"distribution_gain_recognized","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distribution_gain_recognized"}},{"label":"distributed_property_basis","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:property","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distributed_property_basis"}},{"label":"distributee_outside_basis_after_distribution","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distributee_outside_basis_after_distribution"}}],"title":"§732–733 · property and outside basis","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#citizen_of_us_or_domestic_corporation"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_credit_regime_elected"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","28000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_paid_or_accrued"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","30000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#us_tax_before_credit_input"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","120000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_source_taxable_income_input"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","160000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#worldwide_taxable_income_input"}],"id":"complete-ftc","question":"Using law as of June 30, 2025, calculate the foreign tax credit for 2025 in one established basket: US citizen with an established effective §901 credit election; eligible foreign income tax paid is $28,000; US tax before credit is $30,000; foreign-source taxable income for §904 is $120,000 and worldwide taxable income for §904 is $160,000. No §911 benefits, loss recapture, carryovers, treaty resourcing or additional adjustments apply. Compute the limitation and allowed credit, not residence or wage-source classification.","scope":"One established income basket, no §911 exclusion, carryovers, loss recapture, treaty resourcing or other adjustments. Income source and taxes have already been determined.","steps":[{"label":"section_904_limitation","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","30000 USD","120000 USD","160000 USD","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-international","predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#section_904_limitation"}},{"label":"foreign_tax_credit_allowed","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-international","predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_credit_allowed"}}],"title":"§901–904 · credit and limitation","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","9000000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#gross_estate"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","ExpensesIndebtednessAndTaxes","500000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#estate_deduction_allowed"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","2000000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#adjusted_taxable_gifts"}],"id":"complete-estate","question":"For a death on June 30, 2025, calculate the taxable estate, §2001 tentative tax base and tentative tax only. Gross estate is established at $9,000,000; allowed §2053 deductions are $500,000; adjusted taxable gifts are established at $2,000,000. No §2201 reduced schedule applies. Stop before gift-tax adjustment, unified credit and other credits; do not label the tentative tax as final tax due.","scope":"Tentative tax before gift-tax adjustment and credits only. Does not determine §2010 exclusion, DSUE, QDOT, marital deduction or final estate liability.","steps":[{"label":"taxable_estate","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-estate-gift","predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#taxable_estate"}},{"label":"tentative_tax_base","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-estate-gift","predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#tentative_tax_base"}},{"feed":{"predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir:table:rate-schedule-2001c/input","step":"tentative_tax_base"},"label":"tentative_tax","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:estate","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-estate-gift","predicate":"urn:us:irc:estate_gift:clir#tentative_tax"}}],"title":"§2001 · taxable base and tentative tax","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#would_qualify_under_354_or_355_but_for_other_property"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","1100000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#realized_gain_on_exchange_356"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","300000 USD","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#money_or_other_property_received_356"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","400000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#exchange_basis_of_property_exchanged"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#other_property_fmv_received_358"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","300000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#money_received_358"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#loss_recognized_on_exchange_358"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","0 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#dividend_treated_amount_358"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:ownership-change","urn:irc:example:corporation","60"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#five_percent_shareholder_percentage_increase"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:ownership-change","1200000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#old_loss_corporation_value_382b1"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:ownership-change","urn:irc:example:post-year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#post_change_year_382"},{"args":["tax_exempt"],"predicate":"urn:us:irs:rev_rul_afr:clir:table:afr-382-2026-19-t3/input"}],"id":"complete-corporate","question":"An ownership change occurs on October 1, 2026. The section 382 testing-period increase for 5-percent shareholders is explicitly established at 60 percentage points, not merely a reported ownership percentage. Old loss corporation value immediately before the change is $1,200,000. Calculate the base §382 limitation for a full post-change year using pinned October 2026 Table 3; no other adjustments apply. In the qualifying shareholder exchange, realized gain is already established at $1,100,000, stock basis at $400,000, cash received at $300,000, other-property FMV zero, recognized loss zero and dividend treatment zero. Qualification under §354/355 but for boot is established. Compute §356 recognized boot gain and §358 substituted basis. Do not decide §368 classification or total tax.","scope":"Amount-only calculation with §354/355 qualification and no dividend treatment already established; full post-change year, no built-in gains, carryforwards, business-discontinuance or bankruptcy adjustments. This does not adjudicate §368 or calculate total tax/NOL deduction.","steps":[{"label":"boot_recognized_gain_356a","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2026-10-01","package":"us-irc-corporations","predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#boot_recognized_gain_356a"}},{"feed":{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","$value"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#gain_recognized_on_exchange_358","step":"boot_recognized_gain_356a"},"label":"substituted_basis_358","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2026-10-01","package":"us-irc-corporations","predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#substituted_basis_358"}},{"label":"section382_table3_rate","request":{"args":["tax_exempt","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2026-10-01","package":"us-irs-rev-rul-afr","predicate":"urn:us:irs:rev_rul_afr:clir#section382_table3_rate"}},{"feed":{"args":["urn:irc:example:ownership-change","$value"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#long_term_tax_exempt_rate_382b1","step":"section382_table3_rate"},"label":"section_382_limitation","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:ownership-change","urn:irc:example:post-year","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2026-10-01","package":"us-irc-corporations","predicate":"urn:us:irc:corporations:clir#section_382_limitation"}}],"title":"§356, §358, §382 · boot, basis and limit","year":"2026"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","2025-03-01","2000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#loss_claimed_on_sale_of_stock_or_securities"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","urn:irc:example:new","2025-03-15"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#acquired_substantially_identical_stock_or_securities"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#quantity_acquired_not_less_than_quantity_sold"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:old","2025-03-01","8000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:core#adjusted_basis"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","6000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#stock_disposition_price_1091"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:new","2025-03-15","5000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#replacement_acquisition_price_1091"}],"id":"complete-wash-sale","question":"On March 1, 2025, a taxpayer sells a fully matched stock lot for $6,000 with adjusted basis $8,000, realizing a stated $2,000 loss. On March 15 they buy the same quantity of substantially identical stock for $5,000. Quantity matching and substantial identity are established. Using law as of June 30, 2025, compute the §1091 disallowed loss and replacement basis. Do not add the loss to the old basis instead of the replacement acquisition cost.","scope":"Fully matched equal quantities and established substantially-identical stock; partial-lot allocation and alternative wash-sale transactions are outside this case.","steps":[{"label":"wash_sale_loss_disallowed","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","?amount"],"deadlinePolicy":"urn:us:irc:core#IRC_CALENDAR_STEP","kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-property-transactions","predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#wash_sale_loss_disallowed"}},{"label":"wash_sale_replacement_basis","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:transaction","urn:irc:example:new","2025-03-15","?amount"],"deadlinePolicy":"urn:us:irc:core#IRC_CALENDAR_STEP","kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-property-transactions","predicate":"urn:us:irc:property_transactions:clir#wash_sale_replacement_basis"}}],"title":"§1091 · replacement price and deferred loss","year":"2025"},{"facts":[{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#citizen_or_resident_of_us"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#tax_home_for_162a2_in_foreign_country_911d3"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#qualified_individual_by_bona_fide_residence"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","200000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_earned_income_amount"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year",365],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#qualifying_days_in_taxable_year_911"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:year",365],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#days_in_taxable_year_911"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","Joint"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:income_individual:clir#filing_status"},{"args":["200000 USD","165000 USD","28179 USD","0.24"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:income_individual:clir#bracket_tcja_joint"},{"args":["130000 USD","77400 USD","8907 USD","0.22"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:income_individual:clir#bracket_tcja_joint"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","200000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#stacking_taxable_income_including_excluded_911f"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","28000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_paid_total_911"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","200000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_source_gross_income_911"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","10000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#deductions_allocable_to_foreign_source_911"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","70000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#worldwide_taxable_income_input"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","60000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_source_taxable_income_input"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","9800 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_paid_or_accrued"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#citizen_of_us_or_domestic_corporation"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_tax_credit_regime_elected"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","35000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#housing_expenses"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","14200 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#housing_cost_amount_not_employer_provided"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#citizen_or_resident_of_us"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#tax_home_for_162a2_in_foreign_country_911d3"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#qualified_individual_by_bona_fide_residence"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year","25000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_earned_income_amount"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year","40000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#housing_expenses"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year","18200 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#housing_cost_amount_not_employer_provided"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year2"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#tax_home_for_162a2_in_foreign_country_911d3"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year2"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#qualified_individual_by_bona_fide_residence"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year2","150000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#foreign_earned_income_amount"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year2","5000 USD"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#housing_cost_amount_not_employer_provided"},{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer2","urn:irc:example:year","urn:irc:example:year2"],"predicate":"urn:us:irc:international:clir#succeeding_taxable_year_911"}],"id":"chain-feie-housing-ftc","question":"A joint filer bona fide resident abroad for all of 2025 (foreign tax home established) earns $200,000 of foreign earned income and pays $28,000 foreign income tax; $10,000 deductions are allocable to foreign-source income and worldwide taxable income is $70,000. An effective §901 credit election is established and the filer is a US citizen for §901(b)(1). Housing expenses are $35,000, none employer-provided. Using law as of June 30, 2025: compute the prorated §911(a)(1) exclusion, the housing cost amount and deduction, the §911(f) stacking tax from the rate tables (not from asserted tax amounts), the creditable foreign tax after the §911(d)(6) allocation, the §904 foreign-source base, limitation and allowed credit. A second person earns $25,000 with $40,000 housing expenses (none employer-provided): compute the 2025 carryover and the 2026 deduction with carryover ($150,000 income, $5,000 own amount).","scope":"Joint 2025 return: full-year bona fide residence with an established foreign tax home; $200,000 foreign earned income; $28,000 foreign tax paid; $10,000 allocable deductions; worldwide taxable income $70,000 as an established return figure. Housing: $35,000 expenses, employer provided none. A second low-income person carries housing disallowance 2025→2026. The §904 tail restates engine-proved figures (steps 4 and 6) as return inputs; the §901(b)(1) citizenship classification and an established effective §901 election gate the tail, and the engine-computed stacking tax feeds the §904 formula as the US tax before credit in both the limitation and the allowed-credit steps. Stacking uses the pinned TCJA base tables (joint); the two applicable rows (bracket-4 at $200,000, bracket-3 at $130,000, anchor IRC_S1_J_2_A_TABLE_1) are case facts read from the pinned sidecar, both §1 amounts stay engine-computed. 2025-indexed brackets are out of scope. No carryovers, baskets beyond General, or treaty resourcing.","steps":[{"label":"foreign_earned_income_exclusion_prorated_911","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:taxpayer","urn:irc:example:year","?amount"],"kind":"collect",