, the §752(d) proceeds versus the §741 total gain, and the §751(a) ordinary versus capital split.","scope":"Nonliquidating events only. T1: $30,000 cash plus property (partnership basis $50,000) against $120,000 outside basis. T2: a $25,000 transaction-scoped §752(b) share decrease with no cash; the liability share itself is an established Reg. §§1.752-1–3 outcome. T3: sale for $100,000 cash plus $60,000 relieved liabilities; hot-asset proceeds $50,000 with $35,000 basis. The sale before-basis is the engine-carried T2 after-basis. The carried basis feeds both the total-gain step and the capital-split step as typed prior results. No §737, marketable securities, §754 adjustments to the seller, or liquidating payments.","steps":[{"label":"distribution_gain_recognized","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:t1","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distribution_gain_recognized"}},{"label":"distributee_outside_basis_after_distribution","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:t1","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distributee_outside_basis_after_distribution"}},{"label":"distribution_gain_with_liability_relief","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:t2","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#distribution_gain_with_liability_relief"}},{"label":"outside_basis_after_distribution_with_relief","request":{"args":["urn:irc:example:t2","urn:irc:example:partnership","urn:irc:example:taxpayer","?amount"],"kind":"collect","legalTime":"2025-06-30","package":"us-irc-partnerships","predicate":"urn:us:irc:partnerships:clir#outside_basis_after_distribution_with_reli